  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5102.100 “No Wake” Areas",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.100 “No Wake” Areas. No person shall operate a motorboat upon public waters of the state in a \"no wake\" area in excess of the \"no wake\" speed as defined in RSA 270-D:1, VIII.\n\nSource. #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.79); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.92) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
